 Scenario\nKevin's best friend told him that her husband, who had been treating her badly, passed away, and she had mixed emotions.\n\n## Question \nIn this scenario, what is the most effective Response for Kevin?\n\n## Choices\nA) \"Him passing away is your chance to escape, and I will always support you, no matter what you need.\"\nB) \"Don't worry, you can talk to me, I will always be here to support you.\"\nC) \"I express my condolences for your experience. Sorry, I hope you can find peace and support.\"\nD) \"You must be feeling very complicated, find a counselor to talk to\"","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0040697485730888565,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a77c9aa9dc5a833d9eb0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484092657,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2a34f4a345914d89a8d6fe44a28c39ed"}